e, it must see the dog (as per the given condition).\n\n4. **Conclusion:**.\n   - The tiger sees the dog because it is green and big and it sees the mouse.\n\nTherefore, the statement "The tiger does not see the dog" is false.\n\n<answer>. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
