green then they are nice).\n   - Therefore, since Dave is smart, Dave must be green.\n   - Since Dave is green, Dave must be nice.\n\n4. **Conclusion:**.\n   - Based on the given information, Dave is indeed nice. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
