owever, we need to find a direct link from the cat visiting the lion to the cat liking the mouse.\n   - Given the information, we cannot directly derive that the cat likes the mouse from the given statements. Therefore, my final option is: ']] 12%|#1        | 71/600 [05:11<04:19,  2.04it/s] 12%|#2        | 72/600 [05:11<03:54,  2.25it/s]
