t make Dave not green. The only relevant information about Dave is that he is not nice. This does not directly impact his greenness because the general rule states that all furry people are green.\n\nGiven that all furry people are green and Dave is furry, the statement "Dave is green" is consistent with the provided information. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
