ion then they are green.\n   - If the bald eagle is red then the bald eagle is nice.\n   - All nice people are cold.\n   - If someone chases the dog and the dog likes the cat then they see the bald eagle.\n   - If someone is rough then they like the dog.\n\n2. **Key Information:**.\n   - The lion is green.\n   - The lion is rough.\n   - All rough people are nice.\n   - All nice people are cold.\n   - The lion is not cold (since it is rough and all rough people are nice, and all nice people are cold).\n\n3. **Conclusion:**.\n   - Since the lion is rough, and all rough people are nice, and all nice people are cold, the lion must be cold. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
