 all round, furry people are green.\n   - However, we do not have information about Erin\'s roundness or furry status.\n\n5. **Determine if Erin is big:**.\n   - We know that all green people are big.\n   - Since we do not know if Erin is green, we cannot definitively conclude that Erin is big.\n\n6. **Determine if Erin is furry:**.\n   - We know that all round, furry people are green.\n   - Since we do not know if Erin is round or furry, we cannot definitively conclude that Erin is furry.\n\n7. **Conclusion:**.\n   - Based on the given information, we do not have enough details to determine if Erin is furry or not. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
