use we do not know if she is rough.\n\n5. **Consider the possibility of Fiona being young:**.\n   - Since Fiona is round and we do not have direct information about her being rough or not, we cannot definitively conclude whether she is young or not based on the given rules.\n\n6. **Conclusion:**.\n   - The information provided does not give us enough certainty to determine whether Fiona is young or not. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
