irrel.\n- The lion eats the cow, and since the lion is nice, it does not eat the cow.\n- The lion likes the squirrel, and since the lion is nice, it does not eat the squirrel.\n\nGiven all these deductions, we can conclude that the squirrel does not eat the lion. Therefore, my final option is: ']] 48%|####8     | 290/600 [22:49<05:09,  1.00it/s] 48%|####8     | 291/600 [22:49<03:54,  1.32it/s]
