since she is furry).\n- Anne is young (since she is quiet).\n- Anne is kind (since she is young).\n\nNow, let\'s check if Anne can be rough:.\n- **Young, kind people are rough.** (From point 9).\n- Since Anne is young and kind, she should be rough according to this rule.\n\nTherefore, based on the given information, Anne is rough. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
